    "Continue monitoring recovery signals closely, as recommended last period; your total tonnage is substantial and staying ahead of fatigue will be key to sustaining this positive trend."
  ],
  "contextSummary": "Back strength index jumped from 106 to 110 with 12 sets and dominant volume share of 55.6%; chest and shoulders at minimum maintenance volume with flat strength indices; no deload needed."
}
